NOTE ON DEPENDENCIES

The MIT licence above covers this repository's own source. It does not, and
cannot, relicense the projects this one is built on. Two in particular have
their own terms you must honour:

  * Remotion (https://remotion.dev) — the rendering engine. Free for
    individuals and small teams; companies above a certain size need a paid
    licence. See https://remotion.dev/license before using this in a
    commercial setting.

  * Bundled icons and brand logos — Lucide (ISC) and Simple Icons (CC0).
    Third-party brand logos are used nominatively; the trademarks remain the
    property of their owners.

The README's "Credits & attribution" section lists every upstream project.
